Effect models used in this directory:

bomb.glb        Bomb (Quaternius)
                Source: https://poly.pizza/m/0oNZ1y6ghg
                License: CC0 1.0 (no attribution required;
                  acknowledged here as a courtesy)
                Used as a fading "ghost bomb" hint that flashes
                on each newly-placed mark to teach the player
                what marking a tile signals.
